WEBVTT

00:28:28.743 --> 00:28:31.443
Is there an argument that
there is a lot of truth

00:28:31.467 --> 00:28:38.180
in some of the anchoring ideas that
motivate that drive for social justice?

00:28:38.204 --> 00:28:42.014
Would you argue that part of the problem
is that the very language

00:28:42.038 --> 00:28:45.857
and the animation behind that effort

00:28:45.881 --> 00:28:49.304
doesn't give any choice to either side
other than to engage in the push?

00:28:49.328 --> 00:28:52.032
There is no talk about possibility,

00:28:52.056 --> 00:28:55.515
about how to sort of build
something outside

00:28:55.539 --> 00:28:57.242
that would create more possibility?

00:28:57.266 --> 00:29:00.980
It does become, essentially, a battle
for power between different tribes.